<h5>ATTENTION CONSERVATION ORGANIZATIONS!</h5>
<p>Outdoor News would like to list your upcoming banquet or event in our Outdoor Calendar. At least four weeks prior to your event provide: date, time, place, organization name, how many people will be attending, a phone number where the public can call for more information and your name and address.</p>
<p>Outdoor News will contribute newspapers for distribution at your banquet and free subscriptions to give as door prizes.</p>
<h5>SUBMIT ONLINE!</h5>
<p>Go to <a href="https://www.outdoornews.com/submit-event/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.outdoornews.com/submit-event/</a> or mail all required info four weeks prior to your event to:</p>
<p><b>Outdoor News </b>Subscription services, ATTN: Calendar</p>
<p>Ohio Outdoor News, PO Box 1010 Delaware, OH 43015 or email to <a href="mailto:mmoore@outdoornews.com">mmoore@outdoornews.com</a></p>
